@Node LineWrap()

zmf.library/LineWrap

    NAME
      LineWrap

    SYNOPSIS
      void LineWrap( Buffer, WrapLen )
       d0               a0      d0

      void LineWrap( char *, ULONG )

    FUNCTION
      Simple LineWrap Function. This should be called with
      '\n' linefeeded text, ending with a null terminator.
      Any '\r's found will be converted to '\n's.

    INPUTS
      Buffer - Text to Wrap
      WrapLen - Border to wrap at!

    RESULTS
      None.

    BUGS
      ToDo : Add support for '\r\n' HARDRETURN pairs.

@EndNode

